<html><head><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8" /></head><body><p style="text-align:center;line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:15pt;margin-bottom:20pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;border-left:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-top:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-right:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-bottom:2.25pt solid #1e3a8a;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:20pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e3a8a;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e3a8a"><b>📖 HƯỚNG DẪN SỬ DỤNG PHẦN MỀM QUẢN LÝ TIỆC CƯỚI</b></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:4pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b">Tài liệu này cung cấp hướng dẫn từng bước chi tiết giúp nhân viên Sales, Kế toán, Quản lý sảnh và Ban Giám đốc dễ dàng vận hành hệ thống </span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#0f172a"><b>Phần mềm Quản lý Tiệc Cưới</b></span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b">.</span></p><p style="text-align:center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;border:none;border-left:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-top:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-right:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-bottom:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000"><img style="max-width:100%;" width="603" height="2" src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAlsAAAACCAYAAABv2xlnAAAABmJLR0QA/wD/AP+gvaeTAAAACXBIWXMAAA7EAAAOxAGVKw4bAAAANUlEQVR4nO3OQQmAABRAsSeYxZy/l+DdCBbxbAlBkC3BlpnZqj0AAN52rtVdHV9PAAB+6HoAiqEFvVE2A64AAAAASUVORK5CYII="/></span></p><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:20pt;margin-bottom:10pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;border-left:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-top:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-right:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-bottom:1pt solid #cbd5e1;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:14pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e40af;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e40af"><b>📋 MỤC LỤC</b></span></p><ol style="padding-left:35pt"><li style="list-style-type: decimal"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><a href="#anchor-1" title="#anchor-1"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#2563eb;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#2563eb"><u>Hướng Dẫn Thao Tác Cơ Bản</u></span></a></p></li><li style="list-style-type: decimal"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;border-left:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-top:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-right:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-bottom:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><a href="#anchor-2" title="#anchor-2"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#2563eb;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#2563eb"><u>Quy Trình Quản Lý Tiệc (Core Business Flow)</u></span></a></p></li></ol><ul style="padding-left:36pt"><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><a href="#anchor-3" title="#anchor-3"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#2563eb;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#2563eb"><u>Bước 1: Tạo Hồ Sơ Khách Hàng</u></span></a></p></li><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><a href="#anchor-4" title="#anchor-4"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#2563eb;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#2563eb"><u>Bước 2: Đón Tiếp Khách Tham Quan</u></span></a></p></li><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><a href="#anchor-5" title="#anchor-5"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#2563eb;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#2563eb"><u>Bước 3: Biên Nhận Cọc Chỗ (Lần 1 &amp; Lần 2)</u></span></a></p></li><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><a href="#anchor-6" title="#anchor-6"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#2563eb;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#2563eb"><u>Bước 4: Lập Hợp Đồng Tiệc Cưới</u></span></a></p></li><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><a href="#anchor-7" title="#anchor-7"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#2563eb;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#2563eb"><u>Bước 5: Thay Đổi - Bổ Sung Hợp Đồng</u></span></a></p></li><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><a href="#anchor-8" title="#anchor-8"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#2563eb;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#2563eb"><u>Bước 6: Thông Tin Sắp Đặt Tiệc (BEO)</u></span></a></p></li><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;border-left:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-top:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-right:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-bottom:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><a href="#anchor-9" title="#anchor-9"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#2563eb;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#2563eb"><u>Bước 7: Quyết Toán &amp; Thanh Lý Tiệc</u></span></a></p></li></ul><ol style="padding-left:35pt"><li style="list-style-type: decimal"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;border-left:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-top:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-right:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-bottom:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><a href="#anchor-10" title="#anchor-10"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#2563eb;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#2563eb"><u>Hệ Thống Báo Cáo Tiệc &amp; Thống Kê</u></span></a></p></li></ol><ul style="padding-left:36pt"><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><a href="#anchor-11" title="#anchor-11"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#2563eb;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#2563eb"><u>3.1. Báo Cáo Doanh Thu Tiệc</u></span></a></p></li><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><a href="#anchor-12" title="#anchor-12"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#2563eb;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#2563eb"><u>3.2. Báo Cáo Chi Phí &amp; Lợi Nhuận Tiệc</u></span></a></p></li><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;border-left:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-top:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-right:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-bottom:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><a href="#anchor-13" title="#anchor-13"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#2563eb;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#2563eb"><u>3.3. Báo Cáo Tiến Trình Tiệc &amp; Khảo Sát</u></span></a></p></li></ul><ol style="padding-left:35pt"><li style="list-style-type: decimal"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;border-left:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-top:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-right:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-bottom:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><a href="#anchor-14" title="#anchor-14"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#2563eb;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#2563eb"><u>Quản Trị Hệ Thống &amp; Phân Quyền</u></span></a></p></li></ol><p style="text-align:center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;border:none;border-left:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-top:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-right:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-bottom:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000"><img style="max-width:100%;" width="603" height="2" src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAlsAAAACCAYAAABv2xlnAAAABmJLR0QA/wD/AP+gvaeTAAAACXBIWXMAAA7EAAAOxAGVKw4bAAAANUlEQVR4nO3OUQmAABBAsSeIMfw25iUwnkkMYAlBkC3BlpnZqzMAAN52rdVWHV9PAAB+6H4AywwEKlg+Jz4AAAAASUVORK5CYII="/></span></p><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:20pt;margin-bottom:10pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;border-left:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-top:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-right:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-bottom:1pt solid #cbd5e1;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:14pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e40af;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e40af"><b>1. HƯỚNG DẪN THAO TÁC CƠ BẢN</b></span></p><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:12pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#2563eb;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#2563eb"><b>1.1. Các nút chức năng chuẩn trên màn hình</b></span></p><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000"><img style="max-width:100%;" width="602" height="91" src="data:image/png;base64,"/></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:4pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;border-left:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-top:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-right:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-bottom:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b">Mọi biểu mẫu (Form) trong phần mềm đều được thiết kế đồng nhất với các nút chức năng chính:</span></p><ul style="padding-left:36pt"><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#0f172a"><b>Thêm</b></span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b">: Tạo mới bản ghi/phiếu nhập.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#0f172a"><b>Sửa</b></span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b">: Chỉnh sửa bản ghi đang chọn (dòng đang chọn sẽ có màu nổi bật).</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#0f172a"><b>Xóa</b></span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b">: Xóa thông tin bản ghi đang chọn khỏi hệ thống.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#0f172a"><b>Lọc</b></span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b">: Tìm kiếm và lọc dữ liệu theo khoảng thời gian hoặc điều kiện mong muốn.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#0f172a"><b>In</b></span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b">: Xuất và in ấn phiếu/tài liệu tương ứng (Hợp đồng, Biên nhận, BEO, Quyết toán, Báo cáo).</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#0f172a"><b>Lưu</b></span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b">: Lưu lại toàn bộ dữ liệu vừa nhập hoặc chỉnh sửa.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;border-left:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-top:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-right:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-bottom:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#0f172a"><b>Đóng</b></span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b">: Đóng cửa sổ làm việc hiện tại.</span></p></li></ul><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;border-left:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-top:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-right:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-bottom:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:12pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#2563eb;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#2563eb"><b>1.2. Hướng dẫn chọn danh sách &amp; nhập liệu</b></span></p><ul style="padding-left:36pt"><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;border-left:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-top:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-right:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-bottom:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#0f172a"><b>Tích vào ô để chọn</b></span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-left:36pt;text-indent:-35.95pt;line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;border-left:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-top:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-right:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-bottom:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000"><img style="max-width:100%;" width="602" height="158" src="data:image/png;base64,"/></span></p><p style="text-align:center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;border:none;border-left:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-top:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-right:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-botto