]</span></p><p style="text-indent:-35.95pt;text-align:center;line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:15pt;margin-bottom:15pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;border-left:1pt solid #cbd5e1;border-top:1pt solid #cbd5e1;border-right:1pt solid #cbd5e1;border-bottom:1pt solid #cbd5e1;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000"><img style="max-width:100%;" width="735" height="318" src="data:image/png;base64,"/></span></p><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000"><img style="max-width:100%;" width="277" height="473" src="data:image/png;base64,"/></span></p><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none">&nbsp;</p><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:12pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#2563eb;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#2563eb"><b>Bước 1: Tạo Hồ Sơ Khách Hàng</b></span></p><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;border-left:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-top:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-