fffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none">&nbsp;</p><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:12pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#2563eb;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#2563eb"><b>Bước 6: Thông Tin Sắp Đặt Tiệc (BEO)</b></span></p><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;border-left:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-top:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-right:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-bottom:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000"><img style="max-width:100%;" width="602" height="300" src="data:image/png;base64,"/></span></p><ul style="padding-left:36pt"><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#0f172a"><b>Mục đích</b></span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b">: Tạo phiếu chỉ đạo thi công/chuẩn bị gửi các bộ phận trước ngày diễn ra tiệc.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;border-left:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-top:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-right:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-bottom:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#0f172a"><b>Thao tác</b></span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b">: Vào </span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#0f172a"><b>Thông tin sắp đặt tiệc</b></span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b"> ➔ Hệ thống tổng hợp toàn bộ Hợp đồng &amp; Thay đổi mới nhất ➔ In bản BEO gửi Bếp, Lễ tân, Kỹ thuật âm thanh và Quản lý sảnh.</span></p></li></ul><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none">&nbsp;</p><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:12pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#2563eb;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#2563eb"><b>Bước 7: Quyết Toán &amp; Thanh Lý Tiệc</b></span></p><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;border-left:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-top:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-right:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-bottom:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000"><img style="max-width:100%;" width="602" height="285" src="data:image/png;base64,"/></span></p><ul style="padding-left:36pt"><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#0f172a"><b>Mục đích</b></span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b">: Tính toán chi phí thực tế sau khi tiệc kết thúc và thanh toán số tiền còn lại.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;border-left:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-top:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-right:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-bottom:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#0f172a"><b>Thao tác</b></span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b">:</span></p></li></ul><ol style="padding-left:35pt"><li style="list-style-type: decimal"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b">Vào </span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#0f172a"><b>Quản lý tiệc</b></span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b"> ➔ </span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#0f172a"><b>Quyết toán tiệc</b></span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b">.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type: decimal"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b">Chọn Hợp đồng tiệc vừa kết thúc.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type: decimal"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#0f172a"><b>Tab Bàn tiệc &amp; Dịch vụ</b></span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b">: Kiểm tra số bàn thực tế sử dụng.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type: decimal"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#0f172a"><b>Tab Thức uống</b></span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b">: Nhập số lượng đồ uống thực tế tiêu thụ.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type: decimal"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#0f172a"><b>Tab Phát sinh</b></span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b">: Nhập các bàn hoặc dịch vụ phát sinh thêm trong giờ tiệc.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type: decimal"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#0f172a"><b>Tab Giảm giá</b></span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b">: Nhập giảm giá/chiết khấu cuối cùng (nếu có).</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type: decimal"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b">Hệ thống tự động lấy (Tổng tiền thực tế - Số tiền đã cọc) = </span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#0f172a"><b>Số tiền khách cần thanh toán</b></span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b">.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type: decimal"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;border-left:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-top:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-right:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-bottom:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b">Bấm </span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#0f172a"><b>Lưu</b></span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b"> ➔ Bấm </span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#0f172a"><b>In Phiếu Quyết Toán</b></span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-co