ời dùng &amp; Phân quyền (</b></span><span style="font-family:'consolas';font-size:10pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#0f172a"><b>Hệ thống \ Quản trị hệ thống</b></span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:12pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#2563eb;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#2563eb"><b>)</b></span></p><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;border-left:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-top:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-right:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-bottom:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000"><img style="max-width:100%;" width="602" height="306" src="data:image/png;base64,"/></span></p><p style="margin-left:36pt;line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;border-left:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-top:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-right:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-bottom:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none">&nbsp;</p><ul style="padding-left:36pt"><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#0f172a"><b>Danh sách người dùng</b></span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b">: Tạo tài khoản đăng nhập cho từng nhân viên, gán thuộc nhóm quyền tương ứng, khóa tài khoản nếu nhân viên nghỉ việc.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#0f172a"><b>Phân quyền sử dụng</b></span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b">:</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b">Phân quyền theo Nhóm chức danh (Sales, Lễ tân, Kế toán, Quản lý Bếp, Ban Giám đốc).</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:3.0000000000000004pt;margin-bottom:3.0000000000000004pt;background-color:#ffffff;border:none;border-left:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-top:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-right:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-bottom:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1e293b">Cấp quyền truy cập chi tiết cho từng form làm việc: </span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#0f172a"><b>Xem, Thêm, Sửa, Xóa</b></span><span style="font-family:'segoe ui';font-size:11pt;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1e293b;mso-style-textfill-f